                    (<y-cell tag="Stat" id="nfep">Heart</y-cell>)
                    <y-cell tag="Level" id="bkkd">11</y-cell>.
                    <y-cell tag="Summary" id="vh7f">Captivate an audience with ribbiting calls and haunting stage melodies.</y-cell>
                </y-list-item>
                <y-list-item tag="Skill" id="92yr">
